  "solution": "Here the pattern followed in **each row **is:\n\n**Third no. = (first no. ****× second no.) + (second no. - first no.)**\n\nRow 1: 6, 12, 78\n\n= (6 × 12) + 12 - 6\n\n= 6 × 12 + 6\n\n= 72 + 6\n\n= 78\n\nRow 2: 6, 15, 99\n\n= (6 × 15) + 15 - 6\n\n= 6 × 15 + 9\n\n= 90 + 9\n\n= 99\n\n**Similarly**\n\n**Row 3: 3, 13, ?**\n\n**= (3 **× 13**) + 13 - 3**\n\n**= 3 × 13 + 10**\n\n**= 39 + 10**\n\n**= 49**\n\nHence, **“49”** is correct answer.",
